         ,THE FLAG OF ,PAKISTAN

  ,LIKE EVERY COUNTRY'S FLAG1 THE FLAG
OF ,PAKISTAN IS ITS IDENTITY4 ,IT HAS
THE COLOURS GREEN AND WHITE4
  ,IN THE FLAG1 THE GREEN COLOUR STANDS
FOR ,MUSLIMS AND THE WHITE COLOUR STANDS
FOR PEOPLE OF OTHER RELIGIONS4 ,THE
CRESCENT MOON ON IT IS A SYMBOL OF
PROGRESS1 AND THE STAR IS A SYMBOL OF
LIGHT AND KNOWLEDGE4
  ,PICTURE3 ,THE FLAG OF ,PAKISTAN3
THERE IS A WHITE STRIPE ON THE LEFT1 AND
THE BIGGER PART IS GREEN WITH A WHITE
CRESCENT MOON AND A WHITE FIVE-POINTED
STAR IN THE MIDDLE4
  ,DO YOU KNOW8 ,A LARGE PIECE OR AREA
OF DRY LAND ON ,EARTH IS CALLED A
CONTINENT4 ,THERE ARE SEVEN CONTINENTS
IN THE WORLD4

