,RECOGNISE THAT PEOPLE USE NATURAL
  RESOURCES TO MAKE THE THINGS THAT
  HUMANS NEED4

         ,LIVING AND NON-LIVING
  ,DEAR CHILDREN6 ,OUR ,EARTH IS MADE UP
OF WATER AND LAND1 WHERE LIVING AND
NON-LIVING THINGS ARE FOUND1 FOR EXAMPLE
GREEN FIELDS1 MOUNTAINS1 ANIMALS AND
HUMAN BEINGS4
  ,LIVING AND NON-LIVING THINGS ARE VERY
IMPORTANT FOR ONE ANOTHER4 ,FOR EXAMPLE1
WE GET FOOD FROM PLANTS AND WE USE WATER
FOR DRINKING4 ,ALL LIVING AND NON-LIVING
THINGS TOGETHER MAKE UP THE ENVIRONMENT4
  ,ALL LIVING THINGS NEED AIR TO STAY
ALIVE1 AND FOOD AND WATER TO EAT AND
DRINK4 ,LIVING THINGS GROW1 THRIVE AND
MOVE1 BUT NON-LIVING THINGS DO NOT GROW1
DO NOT MOVE AND DO NOT HAVE YOUNG ONES4

