 ,THE PARTS OF A PLANT AND WHAT THEY DO

  ,GENERAL ,KNOWLEDGE1 ,CLASS #B4 ,PAGE
#DF OF #IF "<BOOK PAGE #DB">4
  ,PLANTS ARE VERY IMPORTANT IN OUR
LIVES4 ,THEY GIVE US OXYGEN TO BREATHE1
AND FRUIT AND OTHER THINGS TO EAT4
  ,JUST AS THE HUMAN BODY HAS DIFFERENT
PARTS1 A PLANT HAS DIFFERENT PARTS TOO4
,EACH PART DOES ITS OWN JOB4 ,THESE
PARTS ARE THE ROOT1 THE STEM1 THE LEAVES
AND THE FLOWER4

 ,THE PARTS OF A PLANT AND WHAT THEY DO

  ,PICTURE3 ,THIS IS A PICTURE OF A
SUNFLOWER PLANT4 ,AT THE TOP IS A YELLOW
FLOWER1 IN THE MIDDLE ARE A GREEN STEM
AND GREEN LEAVES1 AND AT THE BOTTOM
BROWN ROOTS SPREAD OUT UNDER THE GROUND4
  ,I AM THE FLOWER3 ,I MAKE THE PLANT
MORE BEAUTIFUL4 ,I MAKE THE PLANT'S
FRUIT AND SEEDS4
  ,I AM THE LEAF3 TOGETHER WITH WATER1
AIR AND LIGHT1 ,I MAKE THE PLANT'S FOOD4
  ,I AM THE STEM3 ,I CARRY THE WATER
THAT COMES FROM THE ROOT TO THE BRANCHES
AND LEAVES4
  ,I AM THE ROOT3 ,I LIVE UNDER THE
GROUND4 ,I HOLD THE PLANT FIRMLY IN THE
SOIL4 ,I SOAK UP WATER FROM THE SOIL FOR
THE PLANT AND SEND IT UP TO THE STEM4
  ,DO YOU KNOW8 ,PLANTS NEED SOIL1
WATER1 AIR AND SUNLIGHT TO STAY ALIVE
AND GROW4

