 ,THE ROLE OF PLANTS IN CLIMATE CHANGE

  ,THE ,EARTH IS GETTING HOTTER BECAUSE
OF THE THINGS PEOPLE DO4 ,PLANTS HELP TO
BRING ITS TEMPERATURE DOWN4 ,THEY KEEP
THE AIR CLEAN1 MAKE THE WEATHER PLEASANT
AND MAKE THE ENVIRONMENT BEAUTIFUL4
  ,FOR THIS1 WE SHOULD DO THESE THINGS3
,WE SHOULD PLANT AS MANY TREES AS WE
  CAN4
,WE SHOULD SAVE FORESTS FROM CATCHING
  FIRE4
,WE SHOULD TAKE CARE OF TREES AND
  PLANTS4
,WE SHOULD NOT CUT DOWN TREES WITHOUT A
  REASON4
  ,PICTURE3 ,A PICTURE OF THE ,EARTH AS
A GLOBE4 ,ON THE RIGHT1 BLACK SMOKE
RISES FROM FACTORIES AND CARS AND
SPREADS OVER THE ,EARTH1 AND RED ARROWS
SHOW ITS PATH4 ,ON THE LEFT ARE A GREEN
TREE1 PLANTS AND A MAN4 ,PLANTS HELP TO
STOP THIS SMOKE4

