#C4 ,WATER THE PLANT AND PUT A LABEL
  WITH YOUR NAME BESIDE IT4
#D4 ,WATER YOUR PLANT EVERY DAY FOR THE
  WHOLE WEEK AND KEEP IT SAFE4

